    ["1.组建6人小队，通过组队模式申请对应副本玩法。通常队伍配置需要战士、观众、以及4名可以提供输出火力的非凡序列者。\n2.单人玩家可以通过人机模式申请副本玩法，黑荆棘安保公司会派遣非凡者一同参与，人机模式下队友非凡者的强度和玩家的非凡评分相关，如玩家评分远低于推荐评分，整体队伍实力可能无法通过挑战。\n3.组队模式和人机模式中，可获得的奖励次数是共享上限的。"] = "1. Form a 6-player squad and apply for the corresponding dungeon via party mode. Typically, a team configuration requires a Warrior, a Spectator, and 4 Beyonders capable of providing offensive firepower. \n2. Solo players can apply for dungeons via AI mode, where Blackthorn Security Company will dispatch Beyonders to participate. In AI mode, the strength of teammate Beyonders is related to the player's Beyonder rating; if the player's rating is far below the recommended rating, the overall team strength may not be enough to pass the challenge. \n3. Party mode and AI mode share the same limit for reward counts.",
